  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Police officers in Lumiose have Pokémon help out\nwith investigations, you know.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me, I’ve been wanting to partner up with a\nPokémon called Shuppet.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002C002000492019007600650020006200650065006E002000770061006E00740069006E006700200074006F00200070006100720074006E006500720020007500700020007700690074006800200061000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000630061006C006C0065006400200053006800750070007000650074002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve heard it likes the negative emotions that\npeople feel—jealousy, vindictiveness, and so on.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I was thinking with Shuppet’s help, I could\nzero in on people with strong negative feelings...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’d make it easier to track down criminals. We\ncould even prevent crimes before they happen!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here’s where I need your assistance.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you have a Shuppet, would you be willing to\ngive it to me?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you have a Shuppet you’d be willing to part\nwith?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F007500200068006100760065002000610020005300680075007000700065007400200079006F007520190064002000620065002000770069006C006C0069006E006700200074006F00200070006100720074000A0077006900740068003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, I have one",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C00200049002000680061007600650020006F006E00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry, not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F007200720079002C0020006E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wonderful! Which Shuppet can I have?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F006E00640065007200660075006C002100200057006800690063006800200053006800750070007000650074002000630061006E0020004900200068006100760065003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Having a Shuppet would be a huge help... Yep,\nthat sure would make my life easier...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nice to meet you, Shuppet!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00690063006500200074006F0020006D00650065007400200079006F0075002C002000530068007500700070006500740021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The peace of Lumiose depends on you! Let’s see\nwhat you can do!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020007000650061006300650020006F00660020004C0075006D0069006F0073006500200064006500700065006E006400730020006F006E00200079006F007500210020004C00650074201900730020007300650065000A007700680061007400200079006F0075002000630061006E00200064006F0021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whoa... You’re a big one, aren’t you? You’ll have\nno problem keeping the peace here in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That being said, I don’t expect you to start reeling\nin criminals right off the bat, of course.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shooop!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530068006F006F006F007000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s this? Has it picked up on some negative\nfeelings already? Let’s follow it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wh-what’s going on? This...this is where I live!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068002D00770068006100742019007300200067006F0069006E00670020006F006E003F00200054006800690073002E002E002E0074006800690073002000690073002000770068006500720065002000490020006C0069007600650021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shooo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530068006F006F006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Are you already done for the day, dear?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000410072006500200079006F007500200061006C0072006500610064007900200064006F006E006500200066006F007200200074006800650020006400610079002C00200064006500610072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, no, I’m still on the job... You haven’t seen\nanything suspicious around here, have you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t say I have...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWell, I guess you’re still busy with work... Good\nluck with the investigation.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shup!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300680075007000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shuppet? Why are you reacting to her?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006800750070007000650074003F0020005700680079002000610072006500200079006F00750020007200650061006300740069006E006700200074006F0020006800650072003F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, what a nosy little Shuppet.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt must be reacting to these ugly feelings I’ve\nbeen keeping inside... I didn’t want you to know...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you mean... C-could it be?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020006D00650061006E002E002E002E00200043002D0063006F0075006C0064002000690074002000620065003F0021001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It seems I’ve been too absorbed in my work...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMy wife’s been so supportive, but she’s felt some\nresentment at me for being absent all the time.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThose suppressed feelings almost turned into a\nfull-blown grudge...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 222
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And that’s what led Shuppet right here.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020007400680061007420190073002000770068006100740020006C006500640020005300680075007000700065007400200072006900670068007400200068006500720065002E001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shuuup.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300680075007500750070002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve been living together for so long... I just\nassumed we knew what the other was thinking.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I was so preoccupied with my job that I didn’t\neven notice she was unhappy...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOne fine husband I am.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think I’m going to need your help a lot more\ngoing forward, Shuppet.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll try my best to be a better partner so my wife\ndoesn’t feel the need to suppress her emotions.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSo let me know if I ever need to try harder, OK?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t like how my mind goes to dark places\nsometimes...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200064006F006E201900740020006C0069006B006500200068006F00770020006D00790020006D0069006E006400200067006F0065007300200074006F0020006400610072006B00200070006C0061006300650073000A0073006F006D006500740069006D00650073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shuuu.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530068007500750075002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll do my best to make sure my wife doesn’t have\nany reason to harbor dark feelings toward me...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nThough maybe Shuppet would prefer it if she did?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
